WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.527
Today we will use art to communicate a helpful message. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.527 --> 00:00:06.237
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:09.826
Choose one clear message about a community need.

00:00:11.117 --> 00:00:13.591
Draw a bold image that supports the message.

00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:20.001
Add a few large readable words and check the layout. Compare your result with a

00:00:20.001 --> 00:00:21.303
second example from Ghana.
